value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T07:46:59-07:00","id":1225577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1215105-checking-for-interest-about-a-promethean-short-game-set-in-14th-century-florence?p=1225407#post1225407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So,Cinder when do we start? I Don't have a character yet but it's just because i'm trying to decided between several concepts</div> </div> </div> </div>The estimated start has not changed: late July is when I (hopefully) will be done with the toughest part of my college duties this year and will have the necessary time to dedicate the proper attention to the game. When that happens, I'll make the preparations and we'll start talking about it for real. In the meantime, I'm reading PbPs to get used to it and making plans.<br /> <br /> Still plenty of time to work on that character concept <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link"